|             4      4                                                        |
|o6 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : N = grenet M                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = | -1 0  f  0  j  0  0  0  n  0  0  0  0  0  0 |                         |
|     | 0  -1 b  0  0  j  0  0  0  n  0  0  0  0  0 |                         |
